{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIzL1dXRSUyME1vbmV5JTIwSW4lMjBUaGUlMjBCYW5rJTIwJTI4MjAyMyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"WWE Money In The Bank","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gJSwZJacuc17PFPdpQBL4XEpTZZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsjmemQqy9b6Iga1EO3KGBeWGct.jpg","description":"The 2023 Money in the Bank is the upcoming 14th annual Money in the Bank professional wrestling pay-per-view (PPV) and livestreaming event produced by the American promotion WWE. It will be held for wrestlers from the promotion's Raw and SmackDown brand divisions. The event will take place on Saturday, July 1, 2023, at The O2 Arena in London, England. This will be the first Money in the Bank to be held outside of the United States as well as WWE's first major event to be held in London since Insurrextion in May 2002 and England in general since Insurrextion in June 2003. It will also be the first Money in the Bank to livestream on Binge in Australia.\n\nRated NR · Released 1 Jul 2023 · United States of America · Language: English · 218 min\nStudio: World Wrestling Entertainment\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Action","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.2","imdb_id":"tt25784918","moviedb_id":1128409,"tmdbId":1128409,"runtime":"218 min","cast":["Roman Reigns","Joseph Fatu","Joshua Fatu","Jonathan Fatu","Colby Lopez","Fergal Devitt","Masami Odate","Rebecca Quin"],"director":["Vince McMahon","Paul Levesque"],"writer":["Vince McMahon","Ed Koskey","Bruce Prichard"],"released":"2023-07-01T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Vince McMahon","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3m4Z7YwnTqgLlQWP7A7TgYOJrj7.jpg"},{"name":"Roman Reigns","character":"Roman Reigns","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6BKc77eAUBQdL9MmgBorBc4SMdE.jpg"},{"name":"Joseph Fatu","character":"Solo Sikoa","photo":"https://im